<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel sees Norscan pulp stock drop.</title>
<headline>Portucel sees Norscan pulp stock drop.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp group Portucel said it believed there had been a sharp drop in NorScan pulp stocks in April that could have been more than 200,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>&quot;There are very good prospects about a fall in NorScan stocks that could have exceeded 200,000 tonnes in April,&quot; a company spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
